### Logout Flow — All Roles
### Prerequisites:
###   1. Run 01-auth-and-otp-flow.http — set buyerAuthToken
###   2. Run 02-provider-flow.http — set providerAuthToken
###   3. Run 03-seller-flow.http — set sellerAuthToken
###   4. Run 02-provider-flow.http steps 8-9 — set adminAuthToken, verifierAuthToken

@js { client.global.set("baseUrl", "http://localhost:3000"); }

@contentType = application/json

# ──────────────────────────────────────
# Logout each authenticated role
# ──────────────────────────────────────

### Logout Buyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerAuthToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

> {%
  client.test("Buyer logged out", function() {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200, got " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.success === true, "Expected success: true");
  });
%}

### Logout Provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{providerAuthToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

